{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24615","headline":"闲居自题戏招宿客 · 白居易","name":"闲居自题戏招宿客","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水畔竹林边，闲居二十年。\n健常携酒出，病即掩门眠。\n解绶收朝佩，褰裳出野船。\n屏除身外物，摆落世间缘。\n报曙窗何早，知秋簟最先。\n微风深树里，斜日小楼前。\n渠口添新石，篱根写乱泉。\n欲招同宿客，谁解爱潺湲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24615.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24615","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}